cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Tunisian Arabic NLP Resources"
message: "If you use this inventory, please cite it."
type: dataset
authors:
  - given-names: Fatma
    family-names: Jlali
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-3875-7306"
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/jjlalli/Tunisian-Derja-NLP-Resources"
url: "https://github.com/jjlalli/Tunisian-Derja-NLP-Resources"
abstract: >-
  An access-verified inventory of natural language processing resources for
  Tunisian Arabic (Derja, ISO 639-3 aeb): datasets, speech corpora, models,
  benchmarks and lexicons, each checked for whether it can actually be
  obtained, with the Tunisian share of multi-dialect resources recorded
  rather than counted whole.
keywords:
  - Tunisian Arabic
  - Derja
  - low-resource NLP
  - dialectal Arabic
  - resource inventory
